        "cooked": "<p>I played a game last night where Argent Adept was the Nuclear specialist. &nbsp;His hand was basically Cedistic Dissonant and a bunch of Instruments. &nbsp;I was fighting Voss. &nbsp;Every turn, Voss would play a Spaceship or a Translocator, and every turn, Argent Adept would blow it up. &nbsp;Voss quickly ran out of giant things to nuke. &nbsp;Argent Adept settled into destroying environment cards and letting other players use powers, but those first several turns were sheer glory.</p>",
